---
// /method/ became part of /about/ on 2026-10-21, when the top bar was simplified. A plain redirect would
// drop the part of an old link after "#" (a link to one entry of the story), so this page keeps it:
// /method/#x goes to /about/#x, and /method/ alone to /about/#method. Without scripts, the refresh
// and the link still reach the right part of the page.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Moved to About · The Belt Equation</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://beltequation.com/about/#method" />
    <script is:inline>location.replace('/about/' + (location.hash || '#method'));</script>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/about/#method" />
  </head>
  <body><a href="/about/#method">This page is now part of About.</a></body>
</html>
